<title>USA: Atkinson wins $44 million building  contract.</title>
<headline>Atkinson wins $44 million building  contract.</headline>
<dateline>SAN BRUNO, Calif. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atkinson said its  operating unit, Walsh Construction Company, Trumbull, Connecticut, was awarded a $44.3 million lump-sum general building contract from the University of Connecticut for construction of the New Chemistry Building at the University's main campus in Storrs, Connecticut.</p>
</text>
